<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE - Wholesale sales, GDP, work numbers.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE - Wholesale sales, GDP, work numbers.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following German economic</p>
<p>indicators are expected to be released next week:</p>
<p>    INDICATOR	PERIOD	 PREVIOUS		 EXPECTED</p>
<p>					    DATA		     DATE</p>
<p> Wholesale sales   Apr   -2.1 pct m/m, -3.4 pct y/y  June 4-5</p>
<p> GDP		   Q1    +0.1 pct q/q, +2.2 pct y/y  June 5</p>
<p> Numbers in work   March	34 million seas adj	  June 6</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Statistics Office said the expected release dates were targets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
